          "If finance lead supplies the instruction, keep the instruction beside the supporting timesheet exception instead of replacing one with a summary. A late timesheet exception can still help if it is marked late and linked to the correction it supports. When the timesheet exception is incomplete, pausing vendor contact list is safer than filling the gap with a guess. Keep the timesheet exception in the approved repository and link it to the case. For the November 2 review at Admin Staffing Solutions, record the vendor contact list check with the timesheet exception and the first-pass document accuracy result.",
