          "The source is recorded before the action, because order is what makes the vendor contact list trail believable. When the role intake brief is missing, move the item to waiting with a requester and a follow-up date. Keep queue columns stable: request, evidence state, owner, next action, due time, destination check. If the queue grows faster than it clears, report arrivals and completions, not only backlog. The vendor contact list review at Admin Staffing Solutions should state whether the role intake brief was current on November 2.",
